              "viewIds": [
                "de-bw-gym-chemistry-lk"
              ],
              "role": "authored-acquisition-foundation",
              "officialWholeSourceCredit": false,
              "sourceContext": "physical11-13/printed9-11 process competencies are contextual support, not exact whole4aa case mapping. Physical35/printed33 is Leistungsfach3.4.3(10-13) actual titration/measurement. Physical42/printed40 lists complex compounds among examples for a further selected research substance group; no universal EDTA duty.",
              "existingDependentGoalId": "e22a34d4-ac1e-5afe-8f77-0dfa4fd9f44f",
              "existingRequiresRoute": "e22a34d4-ac1e-5afe-8f77-0dfa4fd9f44f -> 4aa3a130-b517-5ac5-87b2-147fe432cadd",
              "compilerScopeSemantics": "No applicability override or source mapping is added. The pinned actual stock compiler already includes the required jurisdiction. Compiler visibility is separate from official source coverage; these metadata fields do not enforce stage/course. Current views remain CrossStage and retain their existing GK/LK scopes.",
              "topicChoiceBoundary": "Required own foundation for an already authored target under the owner policy including authored topics before a later selector; no individual learner choice or new universal official duty is asserted.",
              "sourceLimit": "The broad BW process and LK analytical context supports an own full data-validity foundation. It is not exact whole4aa source coverage, and selecting the authored EDTA route in SkillPilot does not make EDTA universally compulsory or prove a learner chose an optional research substance group.",
              "acquisitionScope": "Whole unchanged4aa/P and supplied DE/EN materials: cross-reactive colour-test selectivity, controls and documented sample treatment; matched-temperature conductivity comparison and matrix/viscosity transfer. Support for blank, control, calibration and recovery reasoning in the existing EDTA goal; no paper case is real experimental execution.",
              "routeBoundary": "Adding4aa alone leaves its existing ordinary9fc documentation and7d9 data/hypothesis predecessors absent in this view. Those separate acquisition placements remain unresolved; no complete EDTA route is claimed."
            }
          ]
        },
        "title": "Die Aussagekraft chemischer Daten beurteilen",
        "titleEn": "Assess the evidential value of chemical data",
        "description": "Die lernende Person kann die Angemessenheit, Gültigkeit und Tragweite erhobener oder recherchierter chemischer Daten beurteilen, mögliche Mess- und Verfahrensfehler anhand der Untersuchungsbedingungen begründen und erklären, welche Schlussfolgerungen die Daten tragen und welche nicht.",
        "descriptionEn": "The learner can assess the suitability, validity, and reach of experimental or researched chemical data, justify possible measurement and procedural errors using the investigation conditions, and explain which conclusions the data support and which they do not.",
        "requires": [
          "9fc800d1-92d1-5ef6-81c1-33960ae034dd",
